{"availability":"available","full":"scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow","name":"scikit-multiflow","description":"A machine learning package for streaming data in Python. The other ancestor of River.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":798,"forks":188,"created":"2017-11-14T16:46:58Z","updated":"2023-11-02T11:31:56Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"master","homepage":"https://scikit-multiflow.github.io/","topics":["machine-learning","meka","moa","scikit","scikit-learn","stream","streaming-data"],"demo":"https://scikit-multiflow.github.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Machine Learning","url":"https://github.com/josephmisiti/awesome-machine-learning"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","stars":798,"forks":188}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["scikit-multiflow is a machine learning package for streaming data in Python.","creme and scikit-multiflow are merging into a new project called River.","We feel that both projects share the same vision. We believe that pooling our resources instead of duplicating work will benefit both sides. We are also confident that this will benefit both communities. There will be more people working on the new project, which will allow us to distribute work more efficiently. We will thus be able to work on more features and improve the overall quality of the project."],"features":["Stream learning models are created incrementally and are updated continuously. They are suitable for big data applications where real-time response is vital.","Changes in data distribution harm learning. Adaptive methods are specifically designed to be robust to concept drift changes in dynamic environments.","Streaming techniques efficiently handle resources such as memory and processing time given the unbounded nature of data streams.","scikit-multiflow is designed for users with any experience level. Experiments are easy to design, setup, and run. Existing methods are easy to modify and extend.","In its current state, scikit-multiflow contains data generators, multi-output/multi-target stream learning methods, change detection methods, evaluation methods, and more."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"a962fbeb5b1171ba452576490f4ed45eb6c45b0ee2f76c91e739347b81adc929","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"scikit-multiflow is a machine learning package for streaming data in Python.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"scikit-multiflow is designed for users with any experience level. Experiments are easy to design, setup, and run. Existing methods are easy to modify and extend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a962fbeb5b1171ba452576490f4ed45eb6c45b0ee2f76c91e739347b81adc929","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-11-02T11:31:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scikit-multiflow/scikit-multiflow/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T17:59:00.483Z","hash":"a962fbeb5b1171ba452576490f4ed45eb6c45b0ee2f76c91e739347b81adc929","originalBytes":6525,"storedBytes":6525,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["scikit-multiflow","learning","methods","data","both","detection","drift","projects","changes","community","current","data.","designed","easy","following","jupyter","multi-output","new","notebook","python","single","stream","s